# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# The checked-out bytes are what a runner executes: a CRLF shell script dies
# with `syntax error near unexpected token $'{\r'', and leaving that to each
# contributor's core.autocrlf is not a guarantee. No file in the tree needed
# converting when this was added - the blobs were already LF - so this only
# stops them drifting apart again.
* text=auto eol=lf
